### Create Transaction - Cashier
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Bagas",
  "payment_method": "cash",
  "paid_amount": 50000,
  "items": [
    {
      "menu_id": "{{menuId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Create Transaction Response Example

{
  "transaction_code": "TRX-20260509-001",
  "customer_name": "Bagas"
}

> {%
